  "solution": "We substitute the options in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven: 784 ÷ 112 + 28 × 2 - 63 = 729\n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\n__**784 ÷ 112**__ × 28 + 2 - 63 = 729\n\n__**7 × 28**__ + 2 - 63 = 729\n\n__**196 + 2**__ - 63 = 729\n\n__**198 - 63**__ = 729\n\n135 ≠ 729\n\nOption 2) × and −\n__**784 ÷ 112**__ + 28 - 2 × 63 = 729\n\n7 + 28 - __**2 × 63**__ = 729\n\n__**7 **____**+ 28**__ - 126 = 729\n\n__**35 - 126**__ = 729\n\n-91 ≠ 729\n\nOption 3) ÷ and +\n784 + __**112 ÷ 28**__ × 2 - 63 = 729\n\n784 + __**4 × 2**__ - 63 = 729\n\n__**784 + **____8__** - 63 = 729**\n__**792 **____**- 63**__ = 729\n\n729 = 729\n\nOption 4) − and ÷\n784 - 112 + 28 × __**2 ÷ 63**__ = 729\n\n784 - 112 + __**28 × **____0.03__** = 729\n\n__**784**__ - 112 __**+ **____0.84__ = 729\n\n__**784.84 - 112**__ = 729\n\n672.84 ≠ 729\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"option (3)\".**",
